          "text": "YOUR FIRST WORKING PANEL\n\n1. Open Events Tutorial.\n2. Select the button in Design mode.\n3. Properties → Events → clicked → Go to Handler.\n4. Read onTourButtonClicked() in Script Editor.\n5. Run Panel and click the button.\n6. Stop/Design and edit the response message.",
