          "id": "docsScript",
          "type": "label",
          "text": "JAVASCRIPT BASICS\n\nui.get(id) reads a widget.\nui.set(id,value) updates a widget.\nProperties > Events binds UI events.\nui.on() is for programmatic registration.\nplots.setSeries() displays chart data.\nplots.fromScope() transfers captured data.",
