        {
          "id": "tourHelp",
          "type": "label",
          "text": "DESIGN MODE: Select the button → Widget Properties → Events tab → clicked. The handler is onTourButtonClicked.\n\nGo to Handler jumps to its source; Create Handler can generate new functions.\n\nRUN MODE: Click the button and watch the label change.\n\nThere is NO ui.on() in this example: the button event is stored in its .wfpanel metadata.",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 390,
          "width": 940,
          "height": 270,
          "value": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "events": {},
